"""genai: a small client for OpenAI-compatible APIs.

The model never executes anything. It proposes a command or a file operation,
the scaffold (this REPL, or a wrapper speaking JSON Lines) presents it, and a
human decides. Standard library only; Python 3.10 or newer.
"""

